        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>可能出现的 Case 1</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  body {\n    background: #ccf2f4;\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"微软雅黑\", sans-serif;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .slide {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 405px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #ccf2f4;\n    padding: 18px 20px 12px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    margin: 4px 0 14px 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  h1 .bullet {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 9px;\n    height: 9px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #cc0033;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    vertical-align: 6px;\n  }\n  ul.top-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    padding: 0 0 0 22px;\n  }\n  ul.top-list li {\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 12px;\n  }\n  ul.top-list li:before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 8px;\n    width: 3px;\n    height: 3px;\n    background: #cc0033;\n  }\n  .body-text {\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .cn {\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  .en {\n    color: #e8494f;\n  }\n  .para {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"slide\">\n\n  <h1><span class=\"bullet\"></span>可能出现的 Case 1</h1>\n\n  <ul class=\"top-list\">\n    <li>Hello, This is vivi, may I speak to  XXX？</li>\n    <li>Yes, may I know your name？　（初步判断接听为前台或助理，需要转接）</li>\n    <li>what you r calling for？　（不希望推销电话，垃圾电话，无关紧要的事情）</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text cn\">第一个回答至关重要，回答一些对方助理来说 听上去挺像那么回事，maybe 可能是比较重要的事。</p>\n  <p class=\"body-text cn para\">但对真正要找的那个人来说他是感兴趣的，又没有捏造，把自己的利益变成客户的利益，切忌无中生有，诚信为本，把握好分寸。</p>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text cn\">比如：你昨天发了关于xxx的邮件给他，还有一些问题需要跟他确认</p>\n  <p class=\"body-text en\">I send xxx an email yesterday and have some detail need to confirm with xxx.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text cn\">比如：你说最近邮箱不稳定，不确定昨天发关于xxx的邮件是否有收到。</p>\n  <p class=\"body-text en\">My email system is not stable recently, I need to confirm with xxx to see if he/she have received her email</p>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text cn\">比如：发了展会邀请函，打个电话再确认</p>\n  <p class=\"body-text en\">I send an exhibition invitation to xxx, I need to confirm if he/she has received.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text cn\">比如：收到客户的询盘，需要确认一些细节</p>\n  <p class=\"body-text en\">I received an inquiry about xxx, I have some detail need to confirm.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"body-text cn\">比如：报价某款产品给他但未得到回复，需要确认一下</p>\n  <p class=\"body-text en\">I have quote him/her price for xxx product, but haven't receive feedback, I need to confirm with him/her</p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
